})=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\sqrt{2}}\\,-$ {{field-1}} $)$" :question/worked-solution "The definition of $\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(\\sqrt{2}) & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\sqrt{2}}-{e}^{-\\sqrt{2}}).\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186092914 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186092287 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "756e8f32-69aa-55bb-bae5-e906e0d2c690" :knowledge-point/title "Evaluating Hyperbolic Cosine"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a53aa52f-90ac-57a0-b498-dd9f9c7d749b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186091685} {:answer/id #uuid "b689e1d0-c63a-5bae-bb8b-7f3d9311be86" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2\\sqrt{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186091686} {:answer/id #uuid "c3c9098e-8a77-5bcc-b9bb-c1d8b1711f69" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186091687} {:answer/id #uuid "fd045ae5-10a6-5db6-b26d-82a690e48c1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186091688} {:answer/id #uuid "0759a8de-7381-51b2-8108-ad24a1cd1780" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186091689}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fd045ae5-10a6-5db6-b26d-82a690e48c1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186091688} :answer-field/id #uuid "ecfe09be-1736-5f84-bfe5-4f4a75ce88d4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186091684}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c4787d6a-19d8-5cd2-8f30-49b11ddf2a09" :question/math-academy-id "q-9444" :question/problem "$\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{3})=$" :question/worked-solution "The definition of $\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x$ is\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x=\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{3}) & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{3}}+{e}^{-\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{3}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{3}}+{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1/\\sqrt{3})}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{3}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{3+1}{\\sqrt{3}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{2\\sqrt{3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186503756 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186092288 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "65faf418-f3c7-519d-a01c-9fa1566782f7" :knowledge-point/title "Evaluating Hyperbolic Tangent"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0167f467-6165-5edb-9e25-0d0a365490f9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{2\\sqrt{3}}-1}{{e}^{2\\sqrt{3}}+1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186502982} {:answer/id #uuid "316c555c-d647-56c9-b59c-36c16a9b9cf3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{\\sqrt{3}/2}-1}{{e}^{\\sqrt{3}/2}+1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503071} {:answer/id #uuid "a0202326-37e3-5269-ba19-043affa2e41b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{2\\sqrt{3}}+1}{{e}^{2\\sqrt{3}}-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186503303} {:answer/id #uuid "a559c2ba-ee8a-52a3-88f0-cb110a813012" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{\\sqrt